During the session, after visual and transport convergence and again after Pi `/reload`, inspect ownership:

```sh
runtime="/tmp/naxodev-music-$(id -u)"
test -S "$runtime/s.sock"
test "$(pgrep -f '[n]axodev-music-sessiond' | wc -l | tr -d ' ')" -eq 1
