Record the daemon/provider PIDs before `/reload` and require the same ownership afterward. After both hosts exit, verify bounded final cleanup:

```sh
runtime="/tmp/naxodev-music-$(id -u)"
for attempt in $(seq 1 40); do
  if ! pgrep -f '[n]axodev-music-sessiond' >/dev/null && \
     test ! -e "$runtime/s.sock" && \
     test ! -e "$runtime/start.lock" && \
     test ! -e "$runtime/s.sock.bind-lock"; then
